  "label": "The Gang of Four",
  "description": "A pejorative rebranding used in the meme to replace 'The Squad' with 'the gang of four.' The term 'gang' carries negative connotations implying informality, criminality, or illegitimacy, which is used sarcastically to diminish the political stature of the group. This is a rhetorical device that relies on real-world understanding of how language can be weaponized to delegitimize political actors.",
